note exp(-z*z - 0.5625) * exp((z - x)*(z + x) + R/S), z = x with its low word cleared (x = |x|)
fn est_erf_tail x f64 rs f64 to f64
  z = bitcast f64 and bitcast ulong x ulong 18446744069414584320
